{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "満開っ!🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生の長嶋凛桜(ながしま りお）です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日もブログを開いてくれてありがとう( ¨̮ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobntkL9o.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どう？\nお仕事出来そうですか？👓"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "実は\n今日の長嶋､､、\n緊張しております"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なぜって？\n今日は月曜日。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "22時からはレコメン!の放送が始まります。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "キンチョー！！💦"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でもでも\nきっと大丈夫だと信じてます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "休み明けの月曜日\n頑張ったそこのあなた！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "駅の改札口を出たら不意に聴こえてくる\nギターの音色に足を止めるみたいに"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふらっと遊びに来てください☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この緊張をどこに放てば良いのか分からなくて\n一旦、ブログで文字にしてみました😅"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少し落ち着いたかも"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めての3時間1人で生放送!\n一緒にお喋りしてくれるよという方はこちらから遊びに来てください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://www.joqr.co.jp/qr/program/reco/"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ではでは\nまた後ほどお会いしましょう☺︎"}], "source": "official"}